Bas Tu Hai Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie 3 Storeys sang by Arijit Singh & Jonita Gandhi.

Strumming Pattern:

[C]Tum jo ek pal ko mud [Am]jaate

Kya [Em]pata raste jud [D]jaate

[C]Saare sapne yunhi dhul [Am] gaye

Soch [E]ke tumko naina [D]rul gaye

Thodi [C]baatein thode sikve

Thodi [Am]guftagu [Em]hai [D]

Ab bas [C]main hu meri yaadein

Aur ye [Am]justju [Em]hai [D]

Bas tu [Em]hai

Haan [C]tu hai

Aur [D]siyahi si tanhai

Bas [G]tu [Gmaj7] hai [x2]

Lambi [Am]raatein

Kore [C]din hai

Hum toh [Em]aadhe… tere [D]bin hai

Haan sooni [Am]aakhein

Ab bhi [C]taake

Tu [Em]kahaan [D]hai

Bas [Am]tu hai, [C]tu hai

Aur [D]siyahhi si tanhai

Bas [G]tu [Gmaj7]hai [C] [Am]

Bas [Em]tu [D]hai
